title: Mobilise the Free Worlds
subtitle: Put member-world forces on alert.
is-card: true
tags: last_days
card-image: img/card_pact.svg
view-if: finale and not ld_forces_used_today
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; ld_forces_used_today = 1; last_card_timer = ""
new-page: true

= Mobilise the Free Worlds

Alderaan, Corellia, Chandrila and the other Pact worlds can bring their forces to readiness, if they are told to.

- @do: Mobilise the Free Worlds.
- @easy_discard

@do
on-arrival: member_forces += 1 if pact_formed; member_forces += 0.5 if not pact_formed; fear += 1

Quietly, member-world squadrons move to readiness. If the worst comes, the Senate will not be alone.
